      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I’m having the same problem. I calibrate like normal and my avatar crumbles to the ground. The waist tracker and one of the foot trackers swap places, as well as the other foot, I.e left foot tractor takes place of right foot tracker and the right foot becomes the waist. The orientation of the trackers is wrong as well. They seem to be rotated 180 degrees from there proper rotation.",
