      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "SteamVR recently updated and caused some issues with Full Body. Go to Settings > Manage Vive Trackers and ensure that all of your trackers are assigned properly. Let me know if this fixes the issue.\nNotably, trackers floating off/flying off isn't a VRChat issue-- we don't handle interpretation of tracking data from devices. If it still occurs, you need to check in with SteamVR.",
